<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="262092416"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:04.373"><div begin="13.731" end="56.665" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.731" end="23.913" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.731" end="14.800">海</span><span begin="14.800" end="15.518">一望无</span><span begin="15.518" end="17.067">际</span> <span begin="19.513" end="19.748">看</span><span begin="19.748" end="21.180">不见终</span><span begin="21.180" end="22.164">点</span><span begin="22.164" end="22.729">在哪</span><span begin="22.729" end="23.913">里</span></p><p begin="25.663" end="32.788" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.663" end="26.874">深</span><span begin="26.874" end="27.410">邃又</span><span begin="27.410" end="27.826">吸</span><span begin="27.826" end="29.420">引</span><span begin="29.729" end="30.299">我的</span><span begin="30.299" end="32.788">心</span></p><p begin="37.770" end="49.482" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.770" end="38.916">我</span><span begin="38.916" end="39.450">就在</span><span begin="39.450" end="39.716">浪</span><span begin="39.716" end="41.516">里</span> <span begin="43.544" end="43.744">飘</span><span begin="43.744" end="45.211">飘荡荡 </span><span begin="45.211" end="46.442">爱有时</span><span begin="46.442" end="46.736">忽</span><span begin="46.736" end="47.278">高</span><span begin="47.278" end="48.227">有时</span><span begin="48.227" end="49.482">低</span></p><p begin="49.785" end="56.665" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.785" end="50.719">推</span><span begin="50.719" end="51.268">着我</span><span begin="51.268" end="51.617">向</span><span begin="51.617" end="53.052">前</span><span begin="53.681" end="54.465">每一</span><span begin="54.465" end="56.665">天</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.685" end="1:24.349" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:01.685" end="1:12.066" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.685" end="1:03.152">曾经我</span><span begin="1:03.152" end="1:04.501">放纵</span><span begin="1:04.501" end="1:04.800">享